OL,3,GNEWSARace continues for community to
OL,4,Abuy parish pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people spearheading a campaign to
OL,7,Fbuy a pub say its closure would
OL,8,F"diminish the community tremendously"
OL,9,Fas they aim to raise the funds needed
OL,10,Fto take it on from its current owners.
OL,12,FResidents in Danehill are looking to
OL,13,Fbuy the Coach and Horses pub, which
OL,14,Fthey say is on the market as its owners
OL,15,Fof 28 years are due to retire.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
