OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSARace continues for community to
OL,4,Abuy parish pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmericans Duane Lawrence and Margaret
OL,7,FWagner, part of the Keep The Coach and
OL,8,FHorses Local campaign, say they have
OL,9,Fraised more than half of their #800,000
OL,10,Ftarget, which would allow them to buy
OL,11,Fand run the pub through a community
OL,12,Fbenefit society.
OL,14,FLawrence told BBC Radio Sussex: "The
OL,15,Fpub is a gorgeous example of what we do
OL,16,Fso well."
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
